  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Bandaners is your ultimate online destination for stylish and versatile accessories. Specializing in premium polyester bandanas and headbands, our collection features a vibrant symphony of colors and captivating designs that cater to every taste. With a commitment to keeping you on the cutting edge of fashion, we introduce new, exciting designs on a weekly basis, ensuring that there's always something fresh to explore. We are currently adding new geeky and nerdy designs, as well as expanding our categories to make them more robust and versatile. Whether you're looking to add a pop of personality to your outfits or seeking the perfect accessory for any occasion, Bandaners has you covered in style.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The bandanas can be used by both humans and pets. You, your partner, and your dog can all match!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our bandanas and headbands are made from recycled materials. The headbands are a polyester/spandex-blend for additional stretchiness and softness. All of our products are made-to-order, reducing excess production waste.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payment Terms: 10% of sales via PayPal or store credit.</p>\r\n</div>",
